WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.750
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.070
Kodomo no Omocha, New Year's Special!

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:35.740
It's summertime now.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:38.740
Oh, it is? Okay then,
Summer Vacation Special!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.410
You don't need to say "Okay then."

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:46.290
"Feeling Good With a Sana-chan Quiz!"

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:49.830
'kay, let's introduce
everyone on our panel!

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.090
Foist, "Let me handle
everything about Kodocha!

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.510
I'm the main charactuh,"
our heroine, Sana-chan!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.470
Hoy! I'm Sana! I'm out for victory!

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:59.220
Next to huh, the boy who brags
that he's the reason

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.850
that Kodocha is so populuh,
Hayama Akito-kun!

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:02.810
Yo.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.180
Hey, are you nervous?

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:05.520
Not really.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.480
Next to him... Huh? Sane-yan,
what are you doing heah?

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.610
My daughter Tororo is a fan of Kodocha.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.820
Sometimes I watch with her,
so I'm out to win, too.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.860
Your daughtuh is named Tororo?

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.490
Higashiyamato Tororo.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:19.860
Well, good luck.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.160
And, someone who should be
quite familiuh with Kodocha,

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.330
the manga artist, Obana Miho-san.
Please, let me cawl you Obana-chin!

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.540
What is it?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:30.170
I'm Obana.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.540
You're introducing yourself, huh?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.210
Right, and I'm your host, Zenjiro!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:37.220
And his assistant, the white bat, Babbit!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:38.880
Shall we get right
to the foist question!?

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.550
Yes, yes, right away!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.890
"Questions"

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.930
Okay then, let's start
by watching this VTR.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:48.560
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11,
TV personality and 6th grader!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.820
Yiee! It's 8:30!

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.450
Okay!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.830
Thank you, Rei-kun! We got here safely!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.380
Ah, Sana-chan! We have a
live broadcast of "Child's Toy,"

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:16.000
--so I'll pick you up
when school lets out.
--Roger!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.220
Everything was fine up until now...

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.550
See? They're at it now.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.560
Stop this!
Everyone, put your desks back!

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:29.930
It's time to do arithmetic!
It has already started!

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.810
We're already 30 minutes late!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.730
Hayama Akito... He started
picking on the teacher,

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.820
and leads the boys in everything.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.820
He's like the devil.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.320
--It hurts! It hurts! Away you go!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.490
Stop! Stop that! Stop!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.000
Stop this!

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:58.380
I've exposed you adults' true nature.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.220
Cut it out already, would you?

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.850
Let her have it!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.860
They got me. How could I let this happen?

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:21.860
But I'm wearing bloomers, so no problem!
Come on by, anyone who wants to see them!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:25.360
If you think this is over, then you're
one greatly mistaken yelping fox!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.740
In order to turn
the fight to your favor,

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.160
the best thing you can do is to
hit your opponent in his weak spot.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.170
Hit his weak spot?

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.130
Oh, I can do that, huh?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.130
Lizard! Centipede! Water beetle!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.130
Frog! Caterpillar! African snail!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.470
Leeks! Onions! Green peppers!
Carrots! Celery!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.840
Jason!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.470
Dracula!

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.140
Anatomical model!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:50.810
Even you must be shaking,
ready to say "Sana-chan, I give up!"

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.810
Hayama! You're not scared at all, huh!?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:58.150
Sana-chan... l, um... I...

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.820
What!? Fear of heights!?

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.490
Here it is!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:08.990
With this, I've got Hayama beaten!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.450
And now, here is your question.
Please listen closely.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.210
In this VTR segment,

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.380
we see Sana-chan flinging challenges
at Boss Monkey Hayama,

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.840
and finding out what his weakness is.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:23.710
During the segment, what was this item
that Sana-chan threw at Hayama?

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.550
Oh, you're kidding me!
You know that one, Hayama?

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.180
African snail.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.560
You're kidding!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.140
That's something you
wouldn't ordinarily know.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.810
One point for Hayama-kun.

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:34.810
You're amazing.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:35.810
Not really.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.770
Zooming on to the next one!
The second round is from this VTR!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.070
Okay, onto the contest! Look over there!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.360
What's this?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.280
Well? Are you surprised?
My Mama bought it mail order.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:55.250
It's an "Easy for Everyone
Bungee Jump Set!" It cost 30,000 yen.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.250
We'll use this to compare our voices.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.420
When you jump,
whoever yells the loudest loses.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.010
How about it? Sounds interesting, right?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:11.510
If I win, you're not allowed to
meddle in anything I do, all right?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.180
Fine!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:33.120
He said "Ooh," right?
He just said "Ooh," right?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.450
I've got him!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.790
Okay!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.120
Jump!

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.880
Here I go!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.800
Ah, damn! She's adopting a strange pose!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.510
She's just showing off.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.810
I lost...

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.110
Okay, this time I'm really
going to nail that Hayama!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.660
Forgive me, Akito-kun!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.500
Hayama Akito! You're finished now!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.370
I got a silly picture of you
there in the buff!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.830
You...

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.250
If you realize the extent
of everything you've done,

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.840
then apologize to everyone here!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:29.880
Come on!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.300
I'm sorry. I won't do it any more.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.810
--Did you hear that? Did you hear that?
--Unbelievable!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.140
He did apologize!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.480
I did it!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.150
And so, here is your question.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.150
The bungee jump set
that Mama bought mail order

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:48.150
--cost ¥30,000. Now then,
--This time for sure...
this time for sure...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.820
how many kilograms does the
person's weight dummy weigh?

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.490
How are we supposed to know that!?

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.830
39.2 kilograms.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.830
How did you know that!?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.490
Hayama-kun is awff to a good stawt!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.500
How did you know that?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.830
Let's charge on ahead!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.670
Ever since you gave up
being the monkey leader,

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.500
you've always been alone,
haven't you? That's strange.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.170
So now you're my counselor?
That's a lot of trouble you're going to.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.180
Oh, I never!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.180
You are such a thoroughly
aggravating fellow!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:19.270
I'll return that sentiment
right back at you.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.520
Oh, no! I can't let myself
play into his hand...

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.520
If there's anything I can do to help,
would you tell me?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.780
Well then, kill me.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.030
You and I are just too different.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.790
It's no use for us to try
talking about it, is it?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:47.000
You think that your way of thinking
is the only right way, don't you?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.800
Well, don't force it on me,
it's annoying!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.340
You go ahead and enjoy yourself.
You don't know anything,

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.800
so don't go sticking your nose
into other people's business!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:58.010
You couldn't understand the way I feel!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.230
Never mind!

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.900
It's your fault, Akito!
Everything is all your fault!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.150
You're the one
who killed Mother, after all!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.160
You're the devil!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.820
You're a devil child!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:23.160
My mother... died as a
result of giving birth to me.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.170
Your home is abnormal.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.580
I'll do my best in this drama!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.460
So you do your best, too!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.630
Maybe I'm shameless,
and maybe I'm a buttinski,

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.130
but I can't leave this alone.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:41.100
Just you wait, Hayama.
Someday, I'm sure to make you smile wide!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.980
You'll be saying "Being alive is
so much fun, I can't stand it!"

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:49.310
And so, Sana-chan was burning
with enthusiasm over her drama.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.110
Here is your question.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.110
I hate this! I hate this! I hate this!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:54.490
--I can't stand losing to Hayama!
--Sana-chan faced off against the
disheartened Hayama at the shrine.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.780
You are such a thoroughly
aggravating fellow!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:57.570
Now then,

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:01.120
what is the animal that Sana-chan
transforms into after this image?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.120
Hayama, what are you, the Quiz King?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.500
Mongoose.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.160
Hayama-kun is winning awl alone!
Everyone else has to try hawduh.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.170
Your hands aren't moving!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.830
This is bad, this is bad!

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.840
Sana-chan, what happened to all that
relish you were taking at the beginning?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.130
I still have relish!
Not rubbish, relish!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.510
We're moving onto the next one.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.590
"Shooting on the drama continues."

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:29.850
Welcome!

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.110
And so, the shooting an
the drama came to an end.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:33.820
Fight time has arrived!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:37.440
Hayama family, this is the last time
I'm going to ask you!

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.110
Don't just sit around here
eating your food, go watch my drama!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.120
If you don't hurry, it's going to start!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:44.700
Come on, let's get you home and
in front of the TV. What time is it...?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.830
Say, Hayama...

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.130
Do you miss not having
your mother around?

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.210
I dunno. I never experienced
having her around.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:02.140
I see. Uh-huh, I guess not, huh?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.930
Listen, why don't I pretend
like I'm your mother?

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.810
A-chan...

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.140
Mama,

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:13.150
why did you have me?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.820
Mika...

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:20.820
Mama loves you, Mika. I've loved
you since before you were born.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.490
That's why I worked so hard
to give birth to you.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.330
Father...

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:34.250
I've... I've... been awful
to Akito, quite truthfully.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:37.840
I always get so upset,
and I can't help myself...

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:41.510
So I take it out on Akito,
and call him a devil...

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:46.510
Natsumi... you're not the one at fault.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:49.980
A-chan, about your Mama...

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:55.440
I love you, A-chan, and that's
why I tried so hard to have you.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:02.200
And so, for Mama's sake,
keep at it, and go on living, okay?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.620
A-chan...

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.210
Yes, that was such an excellent,
moving scene...

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.880
The drama that Sana-chan acted in
touched the hearts of the Hayama family.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.840
What was the single line
that Zenjiro-chan,

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.210
who was playing a police officer, had?

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.220
Eh!? Hayama, how can you keep
going rapid-fire like this!?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.550
It wasn't me.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:27.550
Ah, it was the sensei! This will
be Obana-chin's foist answuh!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.560
Obana.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.770
Ah! You can't go saying
your name befo-uh you answuh!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.810
You don't have to
introduce yourself every time!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.480
We have to take that as your answuh!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:42.490
When you get the answer wrong,
a giant hammer comes down on you.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.150
Taking advantage of the confusion,
Hayama-kun presses his button!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.490
Waugh! How did you...!?

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.490
"Welcome."

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.160
How do you know everything so well?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.160
I watched the video.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.040
--So, during the foist half,
--Ah! Now that you mention it,

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.830
--Hayama-kun jumps out
way in front of the pack.
--I never saw the finished drama!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.000
--Wait till you see what happens
in the second half!
--What an oversight!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:12.520
We are bringing you our special program,
the "Feeling Good With a Sana-chan Quiz."

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.190
Now then, for the first VTR
of the second half, start!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:18.690
Ah, Hayama! Oh, yeah. Here, here...

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.900
Now, you no longer have anything on me.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.330
--Hayama-san...
--He's being overpowered!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:35.080
Don't go around hitting things,
just because you're upset, A-chan.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.340
Hayama-san, what's this picture?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.180
Sana-chan, are you leaving early?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.060
I forgot that I had work!
Farewell, my friends!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.680
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.190
Rei...

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.560
Rei, it's you, isn't it!?

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.860
Um, could you be mistaking me
for someone else?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.740
You can't play dumb with me!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.200
Rei! Call me!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:16.870
I want to talk! Rei, make sure
you call me! I'll be waiting!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.880
Rei! Rei! Make sure you do! Rei!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.550
Asako-san...

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.840
This will be a
Trick Jumping Quiz question.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.510
If you answer correctly,
you will get five points!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.890
--Now then,
--All right,

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.640
--Kurumi Asako-san, Rei-kun's
previous girlfriend from way back,
--I'm all fired up for this!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.810
--has just appeared.
--Five points at once!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.810
Oh, you're pressing in already?

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.810
This isn't going fast enough,
so I'm moving it along.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.150
Let's wait till we've
hoid the whole question.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.230
Now then, what kind of picture
is this photograph,

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.820
that has fallen out of Hayama's pocket?

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.150
This is a trick question.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.990
Ha, ha! That's a hard one
to answer, huh Hayama?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.160
Awl right, Sana-chan!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.500
It's a picture of Hayama naked!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.830
How come...?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.170
Well then, let's look
at the correct answer.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.170
It's a picture of Babbit
wearing sunglasses!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.500
Hey, what is this!? That's cheating!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.840
I told you, it was a trick question.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.510
How are we supposed to know that!?

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.840
Now, now, cheer up. Here's a
come-from-behind quiz question!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.470
If you answer this question correctly,
you will get ten points!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.970
Don't worry about a thing.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:22.860
Right now, you're the most
important thing to me, Sana-chan.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.520
Really?

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.860
Mm-hmm.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.860
I can trust you, right, Rei-kun?

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.070
It almost feels like I'm
the heroine of a Shojo manga!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.450
I'm scattering flowers about!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.040
What is this!?

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.130
You called?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.840
I called.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.430
I see...

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.850
That was pretty harsh, going to
the studio by yourself like that.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.190
I came home safely on the train, too.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.820
That's cold.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:07.980
Bye.

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.860
Wow! How high, how high!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.530
Coming someplace like this,

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:18.200
I realize how much I've been worrying
over so many little things up to now.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.200
Hayama!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.620
You know what? If you drink
some juice, you might feel--

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.210
Sana-chan, aren't you rushing it?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.210
Yes, I am rushing it.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.210
Okay then, what's your answuh?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.420
Lemon juice.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:37.140
The question is,
what did Hayama do after this?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.140
Planted a kiss on her.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:40.140
How was I supposed to answer that!?

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.390
There are only a few questions left!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.810
The next one is a
Lucky Chance Quiz question!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.150
If you answer the
next question correctly,

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.150
you will get 15 points!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.070
Yahoo! I can win with this one!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:56.820
Mother... I'm sorry... Sana has
been deflowered, as a 6th grader...

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.160
Bring Hayama here.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.170
Hey.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.500
Oh, it's the pimp.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.500
Get in here!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.380
What the hell!? This is kidnapping!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:17.180
How do you think it makes a girl feel
to be suddenly kissed by someone, hmm?

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.220
Can a grade-school kid
like you understand?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.190
Sensei, whenever you're ready, okay!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.100
Listen, I'm going to
tell you just one thing.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:30.360
Do it as often as you like.
It's quite enjoyable.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.440
That's all.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.780
That's all? Sensei,
you don't mean that, right?

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.780
Not to worry. I just wanted to
see this Hayama boy, after all.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.280
--Shimura-san!
There's still some cake, right?
--Hmm? Shimura-san?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.450
--Give the boy a piece.
--C- cake? Eh?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.120
--Right!
--What?

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.120
Good morning! Rei-kun was understanding,
and doesn't mind it at all!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:50.790
Love is strong!
Nothing can come between us!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.460
--Sagami-kun...
--Yes?

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.760
You have a visitor. We're coming in.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.970
Hey, you sissy!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:05.140
If you've got some kind of problem,
then talk it out and settle it right now!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.810
Okay, it's up to you now.
Take all the time you need.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.440
Rei...

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.490
At any rate, right now, Sana-chan is
the most important thing to me.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.700
Can I wait for you?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.370
This is why I was avoiding you.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.840
Huh? Asako-san?

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.800
Rei-kun! Asako-san was here!?
Asako-san came to see you, Rei-kun!?

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.130
She came inside the house!?
So, what is it with her!?

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.470
No! No! Rei-kun,
you're my boyfriend, after all!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.010
You can't! You can't, okay!?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.690
I think it's about time...

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.820
So, what happens next?
Now, for our question...

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.150
What is the plate number on the car
that Rei-kun always drives?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.820
Huh? What was it...? Come to think of it,
I never paid attention to that...

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.490
Ah! It was Obana-chin!
Obana-chin pressed huh button!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:05.490
Obana.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:09.500
Ah, you're introducing yourself again!
What are you, a moron?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.830
Huh!? What's going on!?

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:12.500
No, that's the right answer.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.840
See? "O"... "ba"... "na"...

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.840
That's nuts.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.840
Obana-sensei is suddenly on top!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.050
Last Hunter Quiz question!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:26.520
Answer this one correctly, and you
get all of the top person's points!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.180
What kind of rule is that!?
That's kind of thawtless...

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.850
Watch this VTR very closely!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:31.850
Watch, now!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:40.280
What's between you and Sagami-kun,
quite frankly, is not love!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.950
Sagami-kun is an adult, and you
cannot be the object of his affection.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:50.460
It's not true...

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.290
No!

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.800
T- there's something I...

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.140
...I'm terribly embarrassed about.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.470
Just between you and me,

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:14.150
I get pretty embarrassed when I think
about the way I was a little while ago.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.810
Even so...

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.860
Even so, you stood by me
and listened to what I had to say,

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.150
despite the way I was, right?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.160
N- now that you mention it...

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.280
Isn't that just the way relationships
between people work, though?

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:32.290
Take Sunglasses-San. It's not as
though he hates you or anything, right?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.460
Right?

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.090
Mm-hmm.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.130
It's okay.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.010
You can get back with Asako-san.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.800
Sana-chan...

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:48.760
I'll be all right, so...

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.770
H- huh...?

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.430
Sana-chan...

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:57.440
That's weird of me, huh? I'm all right...
I'm all right, so why...

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.190
...am I crying...?

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:07.780
I do think that Rei-kun
was my first love.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.160
I'd like to think that these
feelings of mine are the real thing.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:16.500
And as long as I think so,
it's okay to go on believing it, right?

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.170
That's okay, right!?

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.800
And so, the curtain fell
on Sana-chan's first love.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.140
Now then, for the final question.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:31.810
What is the name of the cute bat that
shows up now and then during this program?

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.140
That didn't have anything
to do with the VTR...

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.480
Yay! It's me!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.150
Sana-chan is going for the win!

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.820
Sana-chan, your answer, please!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.150
Battobi!

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.490
That's not it.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.150
Eh? What did I say?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.160
Okay, can anyone else answer?

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.490
I don't know.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.830
Okay, you're disqualified!

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.160
Obana.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:53.500
That trick isn't going
to woik this time!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.830
Why is this?

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.500
Okay, Sane-yan,
your chance has come around!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.170
Babbit?

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.170
Ah! Sane-yan!

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:00.500
Huh? That's right?

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:01.500
You were guessing?

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.170
Yeah, well, the mole that we
keep at home is named Babbit.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.170
Mole...?

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.510
You keep a mowl!?

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:10.850
In a big suhprize,
Sane-yan ends up the winnuh.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.180
Tororo! Are you watching? Daddy won!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.220
The prize you get for winning

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:16.850
is a hundred yeahs' woith of
pocket tissue and toilet papuh.

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:18.850
Where am I going to put all this?

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:22.440
The runnuh-up, Hayama-kun, gets a
hawt-shaped pretty blood presshuh gauge.

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.110
What does a kid like me
do with something like this?

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:28.360
And, as a consolation prize,
Obana-sensei and Sana-chan

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:31.450
will take home the
composuh machine, Nopia!

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:34.790
Yay! This looks like the best prize!

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:37.410
Well, it looks like we've
managed to end on a high note,

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:38.790
while still having a good time!

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:40.790
Have a great weekend, everyone!

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.110
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:19.160
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.880
he's there.

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:10.420
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:11.760
I have a date with Naozumi-kun!

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:14.260
I've always wanted to
go see the Kamura Academy.

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:16.140
I've crossed plains,
mountains, and valleys!

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.560
Where on earth is the Kamura Academy!?

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:22.850
Wow, it really is a great place!
What will be in store for Sana-chan there?

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:26.520
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 21
of the Crash of the Sea and Fireworks Saga:

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:30.530
Could Be a Small-Size Hayama

00:24:30.530 --> 00:24:33.200
Sana-chan might go wild
after all this time--

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:34.950
Huh? My voice is out of sorts...
